Fonts bundled in this directory are the same ones already embedded in
tachylite via typst-kit's `embedded-fonts` feature (used for print-PDF
export — see `export::style`), copied here as standalone files so they can
also be registered directly with egui for on-screen use in the Editor and
Preview (see `src/editor_font.rs`). No additional license terms apply
beyond what's already accepted by depending on typst-kit/typst-assets with
that feature enabled.

